{"id": "NH.chart_1", "book": "NH", "name": "Sri Krishna", "case_type": "holdout", "birth": null, "lagna_sign": 2, "stated_positions": {"Sun": {"lon": 139.8, "bhava": 4, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Moon": {"lon": 47.7, "bhava": 1, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Mars": {"lon": 91.1, "bhava": 3, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Mercury": {"lon": 152.8, "bhava": 5, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Jupiter": {"lon": 148.9, "bhava": 4, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Venus": {"lon": 102.9, "bhava": 3, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Saturn": {"lon": 224.7, "bhava": 7, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Rahu": {"lon": 106.4, "bhava": 3, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Ketu": {"lon": 286.4, "bhava": 9, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}}, "expected_verdicts": {"H1": {"signification": "body", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "it is occupied by the Moon and aspected ... by Saturn making Sri Krishna extremely handsome.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1007). Raman concludes the native was extremely handsome."}, "H3": {"signification": "courage", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "His invincible prowess in the field of battle is brought out by the neecha-bhanga of the martial planet Mars in the 3rd or house of courage.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1023). Invincible prowess/courage stated as a fact of his life."}, "H5": {"signification": "intellect", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "This is a unique combination denoting wonderful intelligence and extraordinary conversational ability. His was a giant intellect unequalled in analytic understanding.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1055). Giant intellect is Raman's conclusion about the native."}, "H2": {"signification": "speech", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "wonderful intelligence and extraordinary conversational ability", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1056). Extraordinary conversational ability, tied by Raman to the 2nd lord (speech)."}, "H9": {"signification": "dharma", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "Consequently He possessed a passionate zeal to safeguard Dharma.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1086). Zeal for Dharma stated as outcome."}, "H12": {"signification": "incarceration", "verdict": "afflicted", "verdict_prose": "Krishna's birth in prison is justified by the association of the lords of Lagna (Venus) and the 12th (Mars) with Rahu.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1087). Birth in prison = 12th-house confinement realised."}, "H11": {"signification": "elder_siblings", "verdict": "afflicted", "verdict_prose": "It must be noted that Krishna was the 8th issue, all the eider ones having been put to death by Kamsa.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1091). Raman links 11th lord (elder siblings) to all elder siblings being killed."}, "H4": {"signification": "mother", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "Due to the exaltation of Matrukaraka Moon and the situation of Pitrukaraka Sun in his own house with Jupiter, his parents were long-lived.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1093). Mother long-lived."}, "H6": {"signification": "enemies", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "enabled Krishna to achieve victory over His greatest enemy and thus tide over the maraka period.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1164). Victory over enemies (Kamsa and other foes)."}, "H8": {"signification": "death", "verdict": "afflicted", "verdict_prose": "Consistent with the nature of Mars, Krishna departed by being hit by an arrow.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1196). Violent manner of death (arrow wound)."}}, "expected_longevity": null, "track_eligibility": ["B"], "confidence": 0.5, "citations": ["NH:947-1238"]}
