{"id": "NH.chart_12", "book": "NH", "name": "Swami Vidyaranya", "case_type": "holdout", "birth": null, "lagna_sign": 9, "stated_positions": {"Sun": {"lon": 16.5, "bhava": 5, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Moon": {"lon": 100.12, "bhava": 8, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Mars": {"lon": 315.0, "bhava": 3, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Mercury": {"lon": 358.8, "bhava": 4, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Jupiter": {"lon": 260.1, "bhava": 1, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Venus": {"lon": 346.4, "bhava": 4, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Saturn": {"lon": 64.0, "bhava": 7, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Rahu": {"lon": 42.5, "bhava": 6, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Ketu": {"lon": 222.5, "bhava": 12, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}}, "expected_verdicts": {"H1": {"signification": "body", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "Jupiter rising almost in conjunction with Lagna, which is Sagittarius, conferred a manly and noble appearance, with well-proportioned limbs, broad chest and a magnetic personality.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:3433). Noble appearance."}, "H5": {"signification": "intellect", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "It will be seen that Vidyaranya was an intellectual giant.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:3481). Intellectual giant."}, "H3": {"signification": "courage", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "This made him an independent character with clear and decided ideas and a spirit that is fearless, dauntless and aspiring.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:3491). Fearless spirit (Mars in 3rd)."}, "H2": {"signification": "wealth", "verdict": "mixed", "verdict_prose": "Throughout Saturn Dasa which lasted till about the age of 9 years 4 months, financially, the family was in very bad circumstances.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:3562). Early poverty, yet later 'he used his great spiritual influence in collecting huge funds' (NH:3544, from the strong Dhanabhava)."}, "H12": {"signification": "moksha", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "These planetary influences made him a real Yogi and Sanyasi and enabled him to lead a life of complete detach- ment, austerity and simplicity.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:3550). Real yogi and sanyasi."}, "H4": {"signification": "education", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "Due to the highly dignified situation of Mercury, in respect of the house of education, Vidyaranya attained unparalleled distinction in all the Vedas and Vedanta.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:3576). Unparalleled learning."}, "H10": {"signification": "status_honour", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "It was in Venus Dasa Venus Bhukti that Madhava was ordained as Jagat Guru in Sringeri", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:3582). Highest spiritual office."}, "H8": {"signification": "longevity", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "Lagna lord strong in Lagna and lord of the 8th in his own house conferred a long life of 91 years.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:3609). Long life."}, "H9": {"signification": "dharma", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "Therefore Vidyaranya's ambition to found an empire for safeguarding and reviving the national Dharma (signified by the 9th house) was fulfilled.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:3627). Dharma mission fulfilled."}}, "expected_longevity": null, "track_eligibility": ["B"], "confidence": 0.5, "citations": ["NH:3379-3686"]}
