s and his career of conquest are due to the disposition of Jupiter", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:4183). Victory over enemies (Hemu routed, NH:4201)."}, "H2": {"signification": "wealth", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "But the colossal wealth, which history tells us Akbar was possessed of, is most certainly the result of lord of the 11th the Sun occupying the 2nd", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:4186). Colossal wealth."}, "H10": {"signification": "career", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "it was during Saturn Dasa that Akbar's career as an Emperor reached its zenith.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:4216). Imperial career at zenith."}, "H5": {"signification": "children", "verdict": "mixed", "verdict_prose": "In Mercury Dasa the Moon Bhukti, his son Murad died. Another son Danial died in Jupiter Bhukti of Mercury Dasa.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:4221). Three sons born (NH:4211) but two died."}}, "expected_longevity": null, "track_eligibility": ["B"], "confidence": 0.5, "citations": ["NH:4060-4265"]}
