{"id": "NH.chart_2", "book": "NH", "name": "Sri Gautama Buddha", "case_type": "holdout", "birth": null, "lagna_sign": 4, "stated_positions": {"Sun": {"lon": 29.05, "bhava": 10, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Moon": {"lon": 200.75, "bhava": 4, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Mars": {"lon": 26.9, "bhava": 10, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Mercury": {"lon": 53.1, "bhava": 11, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Jupiter": {"lon": 11.0, "bhava": 10, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Venus": {"lon": 6.2, "bhava": 10, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Saturn": {"lon": 24.6, "bhava": 10, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Rahu": {"lon": 86.9, "bhava": 12, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Ketu": {"lon": 266.9, "bhava": 6, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}}, "expected_verdicts": {"H1": {"signification": "body", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "These dispositions conferred on the Buddha, great physical beauty and a magnetic personality. Because of the aspects of Venus, Mars and Jupiter on Lagna lord, He was handsome, fair in colour, stately to behold and of majestic mien.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1302). Physical beauty stated as fact."}, "H7": {"signification": "marital_happiness", "verdict": "afflicted", "verdict_prose": "This explains the affliction of Kalatrabhava and want of happiness, in the conventional sense of the term, on this account.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1337). Want of marital happiness concluded."}, "H5": {"signification": "intellect", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "Gnanakaraka Jupiter and the philosophical planet Saturn ... gave Him unexcelled philosophical power.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1401). Unexcelled philosophical/intellectual power."}, "H12": {"signification": "moksha", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "In his 35th year, in Mercury Dasa, Mercury Bhukti, sitting under the Bodhi tree, on the Full Moon day of Vaisakha, He is said to have attained enlightenment. Mercury as lord of the 12th — Mokshsathana", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1437). Enlightenment tied to 12th lord."}, "H10": {"signification": "career", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "It was in Venus Dasa that his triumphant spiritual conquest of the land took place", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1446). Triumphant mission/life-work."}, "H8": {"signification": "longevity", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "At the age of 80, He passed away", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1452). Lived to 80."}}, "expected_longevity": null, "track_eligibility": ["B"], "confidence": 0.5, "citations": ["NH:1240-1515"]}
