o child was born to him during his lifetime.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1637). No child in his lifetime."}, "H9": {"signification": "father", "verdict": "afflicted", "verdict_prose": "Under the same directions, his father died by assassination.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1659). Father assassinated."}, "H8": {"signification": "longevity", "verdict": "afflicted", "verdict_prose": "First : it is an Alpayu horoscope", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1694). Short life (died at 32, NH:1682)."}}, "expected_longevity": null, "track_eligibility": ["B"], "confidence": 0.5, "citations": ["NH:1517-1706"]}
