{"id": "NH.chart_4", "book": "NH", "name": "Augustus Caesar", "case_type": "holdout", "birth": null, "lagna_sign": 7, "stated_positions": {"Sun": {"lon": 183.42, "bhava": 1, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Moon": {"lon": 303.92, "bhava": 5, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Mars": {"lon": 39.42, "bhava": 8, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Mercury": {"lon": 173.42, "bhava": 12, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Jupiter": {"lon": 111.42, "bhava": 10, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Venus": {"lon": 230.42, "bhava": 2, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Saturn": {"lon": 36.92, "bhava": 8, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Rahu": {"lon": 39.42, "bhava": 8, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Ketu": {"lon": 219.42, "bhava": 2, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}}, "expected_verdicts": {"H1": {"signification": "body", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "He was \"exceptionally good looking, with very delicately modelled features, grey eyes, luminous and penetrating\"", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1765). Good looks stated."}, "H3": {"signification": "ear_throat", "verdict": "afflicted", "verdict_prose": "Three malefics aspecting the 2nd rendered him suffer, all his life, from throat trouble.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1774). Lifelong throat trouble (Raman judges it from the 2nd house; vocabulary places throat under H3)."}, "H4": {"signification": "education", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "While the 4th lord is no doubt afflicted, the 4th is aspected by exalted Jupiter. It is said that he was a scholar from his youth.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1786). Scholar from youth."}, "H7": {"signification": "spouse", "verdict": "mixed", "verdict_prose": "He was married twice — the first a marriage of convenience lasting for only two years and the second marriage endured to the end of his life.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1791). Two marriages: first brief, second lasting (though with slander, NH:1793)."}, "H5": {"signification": "children", "verdict": "afflicted", "verdict_prose": "The 5th lord Saturn is equally well afflicted. He had only one daughter who disappointed him.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1795). One disappointing daughter; 'greatest calamity' was her conduct (NH:1919)."}, "H9": {"signification": "father", "verdict": "afflicted", "verdict_prose": "His father died in his 5th year, when he was having Rahu Dasa Jupiter Bhukti.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1852). Early loss of father."}, "H10": {"signification": "status_honour", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "In Rahu Dasa Venus Bhukti, he was elected into the pontifical college, an exceptional honour", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1855). Exceptional honour."}, "H6": {"signification": "enemies", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "his disposition in the 6th from the Moon (success over enemies) is unique. Jupiter's Dasa lasted from 44 B.C. to 28 B.C. And as soon as this commenced, Antonius was defeated.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1867). Success over enemies."}, "H12": {"signification": "expenditure", "verdict": "afflicted", "verdict_prose": "Mercury though exalted is in the 12th or house of loss ... and consequently Mercury Dasa brought losses.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1887). Losses via 12th."}, "H8": {"signification": "longevity", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "his political career lasted for a long time and ended only when he was 77 years old.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1911). Lived to 77."}}, "expected_longevity": null, "track_eligibility": ["B"], "confidence": 0.5, "citations": ["NH:1708-1929"]}
{"id": "NH.chart_4#2", "book": "NH", "name": "Augustus Caesar", "case_type": "holdout", "birth": null, "lagna_sign": 7, "stated_positions": {"Sun": {"lon": 183.42, "bhava": 1, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Moon": {"lon": 303.92, "bhava": 5, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Mars": {"lon": 39.42, "bhava": 8, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Mercury": {"lon": 173.42, "bhava": 12, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Jupiter": {"lon": 111.42, "bhava": 10, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Venus": {"lon": 230.42, "bhava": 2, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Saturn": {"lon": 36.92, "bhava": 8, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Rahu": {"lon": 39.42, "bhava": 8, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}, "Ketu": {"lon": 219.42, "bhava": 2, "position_source": "holdout_extraction"}}, "expected_verdicts": {"H1": {"signification": "self", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "made him \"one of the world's great men, a statesman, who conceived and carried through a scheme of political reconstruction", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1923). Overall eminence."}, "H10": {"signification": "career", "verdict": "favourable", "verdict_prose": "As soon as Saturn's Dasa commenced, Augustus was awarded the civic crown ... and he became undisputed head of the Roman world.", "verdict_review": "HOLDOUT", "review_note": "Engine-blind extraction 2026-10-24 (NH:1884). Supreme ruler."}}, "expected_longevity": null, "track_eligibility": ["B"], "confidence": 0.5, "citations": ["NH:1708-1929"]}
